            {
              "text": "\n        Lev 13—14.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Take heed, in an attack of leprosy, to be very careful to do according to all that the Levitical priests shall direct you; as I commanded them, so you shall be careful to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God did to Miriam on the way as you came forth out of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
