          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When you make your neighbor a loan of any sort, you shall not go into his house to fetch his pledge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall stand outside, and the man to whom you make the loan shall bring the pledge out to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if he is a poor man, you shall not sleep in his pledge; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when the sun goes down, you shall restore to him the pledge that he may sleep in his cloak and bless you; and it shall be righteousness to you before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
